  "description": "IronPPT is a .NET library that allows you to create and manipulate PowerPoint presentations within a .NET application & websites. It provides a comprehensive API for generating slides, adding text, images, shpaes, and other multimedia elements, supporting the latest PowerPoint features. IronPPT is designed to be lightweight, fast, and reliable, making it an ideal choice for automating PowerPoint tasks in .NET applications.\n\nAn easy and intuitive library to work with ppt files in C#.\n\nFor code samples, docs & more visit https://ironsoftware.com/csharp/ppt/\n\nDoes not require Office Interop. Works well with .NET Framework, .NET Core and Azure. All without extra dependencies or the need to install MS Office.\n\nIronPPT works well in C#, VB.NET, MVC, ASP.NET projects for Websites, Console & Desktop apps.\n\nWorks with:\n- .NET Core 3.1\n- .NET 5\n- .NET 6\n- .NET 7\n- .NET 8\n- .NET 9\n- .NET 10\n- .NET Standard 2  & 2.1\n- .NET Framework 4.6.2 and above\n- Xamarin, SharePoint, Mono\n- Azure, AWS, Cloud hosting\n- Windows, Linux, macOS, Mobile\n\nLicensing  & Support available for commercial deployments.\n\nFind full documentation at: https://ironsoftware.com/csharp/ppt/\n\nFor support please contact us: support@ironsoftware.com",
