  "releaseNotes": "Bug Fixes:\n\t\t\t- Fixed TextStyle.Clone() and Underline.Clone() throwing \"The type must be serializable\".\n\t\t\tUpdates:\n\t\t\t- Updated IronSoftware.System.Drawing to 2026.11.5. On .NET 8 and later it uses SixLabors.ImageSharp 4.1.3, which fixes CVE-2026-106110 through CVE-2026-106116.\n\t\t\t- .NET 6 and earlier targets (including .NET Standard 2.0 / .NET Framework) use older ImageSharp versions that do not include the fix; use .NET 8 or later to get it.",
